    - target: {fileID: 4711005256018735203, guid: 0daf8292e6fd6cf46a68c89d3a946ace, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'Yesshopping is a typing game, made in a 3-day gamejam with a team of
        5.


        Gameplay:

        Write text for the tv show host to speak
        in order to sell items! Dont loose the audience retention! Words are scored
        based on the scrabble score.


        What i Did:

        Shader,

        Backend
        programming for some objects


        Made with:

        c#, unity


        Won
        first place at the game jam!'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
